## 🚦 Application Health Status Visual Matrix

ArgoCD tracks the lifecycle health of every resource it watches using status flags visible on its dashboard:

| Health Status | Visual Icon | System Meaning |
| :--- | :---: | :--- |
| **Healthy** | 🟢 | The resources are running perfectly exactly as specified. |
| **Progressing** | 🟡 | A rolling upgrade or deployment is underway (e.g., pods spinning up). |
| **Degraded** | 🔴 | A critical failure occurred (e.g., a pod is caught in a `CrashLoopBackOff`). |
| **Missing** | ⚪ | The resource is defined in Git but does not exist in the cluster yet. |
| **Suspended** | 🟠 | The resource is paused (e.g., a Kubernetes `CronJob` or paused rollout). |
